{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/9e648a9e7c967cb06b91f4aaf8b55326.avif?t=1758277829\" width=1232 height=706 /></span>Alexandra is successful yet burned out. A night at the club was meant to be a simple break. In the crowd she notices the charismatic Eric\u2014impossible to look away. One drink, smeared lights\u2026 and darkness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in a country manor, Alexandra realizes she\u2019s part of a hunt. For Eric, power isn\u2019t money or contacts; it\u2019s control\u2014the game between life and death. But this time the prey might ruin his \u201cperfect hunt.\u201d</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THE GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This isn\u2019t a tale of notes and scraps. We replaced the usual paper clues with live interaction through a fitness bracelet and phone. They show status, breathing, steps, and hold your inventory and hints. You feel what the heroine feels\u2014and make decisions under pressure.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the house and its grounds, discover alternate routes and hidden stashes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/be03c1fedb3d8dc8cecc12f3c6340fa3.poster.avif?t=1758277829\" width=692 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/be03c1fedb3d8dc8cecc12f3c6340fa3.webm?t=1758277829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monitor breathing and pulse\u2014panic makes it harder to hide or solve challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/643e52e5db0610b3dc636b01d9876d08.poster.avif?t=1758277829\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/643e52e5db0610b3dc636b01d9876d08.webm?t=1758277829\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/643e52e5db0610b3dc636b01d9876d08.mp4?t=1758277829\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Evade or distract the pursuer, using the environment and your bracelet/phone features.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/7a589c5eaa1b8f78b27041f18758abb0.avif?t=1758277829\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras_big/7a589c5eaa1b8f78b27041f18758abb0.webp?t=1758277829 width=1560 height=877 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A relentless horror-thriller:</strong> constant tension, stealth sequences, chases, and psychological pressure.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bracelet and phone instead of menus:</strong> flashlight, inventory, step counter, breathing and status monitoring\u2014all within a diegetic character interface.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A multifaceted antagonist:</strong> Eric is revealed as you progress\u2014his motives, past, and respectable mask.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intellectual challenges:</strong> logic puzzles and clever situations woven into the narrative.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The eye-blink visual effect heightens tension and deepens immersion during moments of danger.</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cultural references: the game speaks with film, art, and literature\u2014watch for details and easter eggs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starring: Dasha Ostrovskaya as Alexandra Kuprina.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2904970?t=1758277829","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/c996d3a8b89fc40e07cf3ba0aa4e009561060b0c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758277829","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/28af7630ffa09bed87c062c064223cd0a0e71c9e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758277829","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/28af7630ffa09bed87c062c064223cd0a0e71c9e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758277829","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":3303210,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2904970/extras/9e648a9e7c967cb06b91f4aaf8b55326.avif?t=1758277829\" width=1232 height=706 /></span>Alexandra is successful yet burned out. A night at the club was meant to be a simple break. In the crowd she notices the charismatic Eric\u2014impossible to look away. One drink, smeared lights\u2026 and darkness.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Waking up in a country manor, Alexandra realizes she\u2019s part of a hunt. For Eric, power isn\u2019t money or contacts; it\u2019s control\u2014the game between life and death. But this time the prey might ruin his \u201cperfect hunt.\u201d</p><h2 c